# The Thunderbird test fixtures (mbox files, prefs.js files, and the extensionless mbox-format
# folder files under ThunderbirdProfiles/) must never have their line endings touched by git,
# regardless of a checkout's core.autocrlf setting. MailFolderReader.fs's mbox parser looks for a
# literal "\n\n" blank-line separator between headers and body; an autocrlf=true checkout
# converting these to CRLF silently breaks every test that reads one (discovered while rebasing
# change/thunderbird-account-selection - the committed blobs were always LF-only, only the
# working tree copy after a Windows checkout was corrupted).
MyDogsbody.Tests/Fixtures/ThunderbirdProfiles/** -text
MyDogsbody.Tests/Fixtures/Mbox/** -text
